                "CWE-ID",
                "CWE-693: Protection Mechanism Failure"
              ]
            },
            {
              "row_number": 4,
              "cells": [
                "IMPACT (Potential)",
                "The absence of root detection allows the application to execute normally on rooted Android devices, where attackers have elevated privileges over the operating system. This may facilitate reverse engineering, runtime instrumentation, interception of sensitive information, and manipulation of client-side application logic, increasing the likelihood of further attacks against the application."
              ]
            },
            {
              "row_number": 5,
              "cells": [
                "RETEST STATUS",
                ""
              ]
            },
            {
              "row_number": 6,
              "cells": [
                "Affected User Roles",
                "No authentication required"
              ]
            },
            {
              "row_number": 7,
              "cells": [
                "CVSS SCORE",
                "6.5 (CVSS:3.1/AV:L/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:L/I:L/A:N )"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "block_number": 287,
          "block_type": "paragraph",
          "paragraph_number": 265,
          "table_number": null,
          "style": "Normal",
          "text": "",
          "rows": null
        },
        {
          "block_number": 288,
          "block_type": "paragraph",
          "paragraph_number": 266,
          "table_number": null,
          "style": "Normal",
          "text": "Observation",
          "rows": null
        },
        {
          "block_number": 289,
          "block_type": "paragraph",
          "paragraph_number": 267,
          "table_number": null,
          "style": "Normal",
          "text": "Running the application on a jailbroken device enables attackers to bypass client-side security controls, inspect or extract local data, manipulate runtime memory, hook sensitive functions, and tamper with application logic. This increases the risk of credential theft, unauthorized access, API abuse, and exposure of sensitive information.",
          "rows": null
        },
        {
          "block_number": 290,
          "block_type": "paragraph",
          "paragraph_number": 268,
          "table_number": null,
          "style": "Normal",
          "text": "",
          "rows": null
        },
        {
          "block_number": 291,
          "block_type": "paragraph",
          "paragraph_number": 269,
          "table_number": null,
          "style": "Normal",
          "text": "",
          "rows": null
        },
        {
          "block_number": 292,
          "block_type": "paragraph",
          "paragraph_number": 270,
          "table_number": null,
          "style": "Normal",
          "text": "Exploitation",
          "rows": null
        },
        {
          "block_number": 293,
          "block_type": "paragraph",
          "paragraph_number": 271,
          "table_number": null,
          "style": "Normal",
          "text": "Install the application on a rooted Android device or emulator.",
          "rows": null
        },
        {
          "block_number": 294,
          "block_type": "paragraph",
          "paragraph_number": 272,
          "table_number": null,
          "style": "Normal",
          "text": "Launch the application and observe that it starts successfully without detecting the rooted environment or displaying any security warning.",
          "rows": null
        },
        {
          "block_number": 295,
          "block_type": "paragraph",
          "paragraph_number": 273,
          "table_number": null,
          "style": "Normal",
          "text": "",
          "rows": null
        },
        {
          "block_number": 296,
          "block_type": "paragraph",
          "paragraph_number": 274,
          "table_number": null,
          "style": "Normal",
          "text": "Recommendation",
          "rows": null
        },
        {
          "block_number": 297,
          "block_type": "paragraph",
          "paragraph_number": 275,
          "table_number": null,
          "style": "Normal",
          "text": "The application should implement checks to verify the integrity of the operating system upon startup and during sensitive operations.",
          "rows": null
        },
        {
          "block_number": 298,
          "block_type": "paragraph",
          "paragraph_number": 276,
          "table_number": null,
          "style": "Normal",
          "text": "For Android:",
          "rows": null
        },
        {
          "block_number": 299,
          "block_type": "paragraph",
          "paragraph_number": 277,
          "table_number": null,
          "style": "List Paragraph",
          "text": "Check for Root Binaries: Scan for the existence of su binaries or common root management apps (e.g., SuperSU, Magisk)",
          "rows": null
        },
        {
          "block_number": 300,
          "block_type": "paragraph",
          "paragraph_number": 278,
          "table_number": null,
          "style": "List Paragraph",
          "text": "Check for Write Access: Attempt to write to system directories that are usually read-only",
          "rows": null
